Harris\",\"uploadDate\":\"2015-10-01T00:00:00+00:00\"}"}}]],["$","div",null,{"className":"page-header","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"container","children":[["$","h1",null,{"children":"Sage one Accounting"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"page-header-sub","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<p>It's great to continue the voice work with the brand behind the nations favourite accounting software.</p>"}}]]}]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"blog-post-body","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"container","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-post-main two-col","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-text-col","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<h2>Watch the Sage One Accounting Video</h2>\r\n<p>Here's nnother explainer video voice, this one for Sage accounting. They asked for a nice relaxed natural read and I'm very pleased with how it turned out. Often, a good explainer video is created by a clear-to-understand script, and that's exactly what they gave me. Check out the >SAGE You Tube Channel for more tutorials and product videos. If you'd like to watch a couple more explainer videos like this one, check out my <a href=\"/wirecard-male-voice-over\" title=\"Wirecard\">Wirecard</a> and <a href=\"/crowd-hub-x-explainer-video-voiceover\" title=\"Crowd Hub X\">Crowd Hub X</a> explainer videos.</p>"}}],false,["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-media-col","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"embed-wrap","children":["$","iframe",null,{"src":"https://www.youtube.com/embed/qlG1294fq9c","title":"Sage one Accounting","allow":"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture","allowFullScreen":true}]}]}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-post-section two-col","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-media-col","children":["$","img",null,{"src":"/assets/img/blog/sage-one-accounting.jpg","alt":"Sage one Accounting","className":"blog-post-img"}]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-text-col","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<br>\r\n<h2>Sage one Accounting</h2>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>Sage One is online accounting and payroll software, with different accountancy and payroll packages available for start-ups and small businesses. So many businesses around the World use Sage One Accounting, so it was a great opportunity for me to get exposure across the business world. And I think the video turned out pretty great, in the end!</p>"}}]]}],[],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-bottom-text","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<h2>Get in touch</h2>\r\n<p>If you are looking for a <a href=\"/commercial-voiceover\" title=\"Commercial Voiceover\">commercial voiceover</a> or an <a href=\"/explainer-video-voice\" title=\"Explainer Video Voiceover\">explainer video</a> voice similar to this for Sage one accounting, then please get in touch. To make the process easier, let me know the intended usage of the project and I can quote you more accurately. Feel free to send a short sample of the script and I'd be more than happy to send you a short audition to check if my voice is right for your brand or project.</p>"}}],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-post-cta","children":["$","$L3",null,{"href":"/voiceover-news","className":"cta-btn cta-btn--outline","children":"← Back to News & Blog"}]}],["$","$L4",null,{"pageTitle":"Sage one Accounting","pageUrl":"sage-one-accounting"}]]}]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"blog-related-strip","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"container","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-related-grid","children":[["$","$L3","675",{"href":"/rise-project-explainer-video-voiceover","className":"blog-related-card","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-related-img-wrap","children":["$","img",null,{"src":"/assets/img/blog/rise-project-explainer-video-voiceover.jpg","alt":"Rise Project Explainer Video Voiceover","className":"blog-related-img"}]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-related-title","children":"Rise Project Explainer Voiceover"}